  "result": "I changed `unsubscribe` in `src/lib/event-bus.ts`. Before the change, calling the detach function did not actually remove the handler. I haven't run the test suite.\n\nThe event bus copies the handler list whenever a handler is added. The detach function was removing the handler from that captured copy. Any handler added after it had already created a newer list, and that newer list is the one events are sent to. So detached webhook, audit-log and usage handlers stayed live, and each re-attach added one more copy. In-app notifications were never duplicated because they attach once, when the module is first loaded, and never go through detach and re-attach.\n\nNow the detach function makes a fresh copy of the current list without that handler and puts it in place. Calling it again does nothing. `registerEventHandlers` in `src/server/services/event-registry.ts` is unchanged, so registering twice without detaching is still a no-op.",
